      "writtenOn": "2025-05-21T22:45:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These arguments aren\u0027t required for all \"method\" types.\n\nThis tool will be easier to use if you have separate required arguments based on the \"method\".\n\n```\nrtkupdate --method frame --file \u003cram_image\u003e --uart-device \u003cdev\u003e\nrtkupdate --method wp --protect \u003c1|0\u003e  --uart-device \u003cdev\u003e\nrtkupdate --method flash --file \u003cflash_image\u003e --spi_start \u003cspi offset\u003e --uart_device \u003cdev\u003e\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 914,
        "startChar": 0,
